WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
Meet two places.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:06.510
Kerala, on the south-west coast
of India, is hot all year.

3
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.110
From June to September, heavy
monsoon rains pour down.

4
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.530
London is cool in winter, with
rain spread through the year.

5
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.520
Kerala grows rice and spices.

6
00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.570
London's economy is mostly
services and finance.

7
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.530
So are these two places
totally different?

8
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.640
Or do they have something in common?

9
00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.070
In this mission, you'll
read climate graphs,

10
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.150
and build a profile of Kerala.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.730
You'll use the UK as
a measuring stick,

12
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.710
and line places up side by side.

13
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.370
Your mission: decide whether
Kerala and London are as different

14
00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.700
as they look.
